-banker-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 371454, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Mtuc6Ci41uQ1NGCGyabEtE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 373079, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and pull request #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer. I did not merge it.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, while its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I checked the test's expected values by hand: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66 both hold under half-even.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986` passed.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nMerging into main needs approval from a code owner, so that step is still pending.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the source file to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QUGc2XtR15wdEV5Y37WTGG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TH2YcCk8QYLYZJ4RWJuzSR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: the docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding, but the code uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`. I checked the test's expected values by hand. Under half-even, 2.675 goes to 2.68 (7 is odd, so it rounds up to the even 8) and 2.665 goes to 2.66 (6 is already 